gametitle=Pro Evolution Soccer 5 (SLES-53544)

[Optimal Squad]
author=EERIE
description=Adds Optimal Squad to the formation screen menu, in place of Controls. It opens Optimal Ability (highest total Overall), Optimal Condition (players in the best form first), Both (Overall after form, as the match uses it) and a Keep Formation tickbox (only the players change, the formation stays). Only players who can play each position are used. Bug reports: eeriegoesd.com

